From: Omarchy Mobile contributors
Subject: [PATCH] sscregistrygen: ignore inputs that are not JSON

Vendor sensor configuration directories also contain list and calibration
image files. json_object_from_fd returns NULL for those files, after which the
generator dereferences it. Ignore files that cannot be parsed as JSON.
---
 tools/sscregistrygen.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/sscregistrygen.c b/tools/sscregistrygen.c
index 6ffdfb5..e9b7aa1 100644
--- a/tools/sscregistrygen.c
+++ b/tools/sscregistrygen.c
@@ -220,6 +220,8 @@ void apply_sensor_configuration(struct config_filter *filter,
 	in = json_object_from_fd(fd);
 
 	close(fd);
+	if (in == NULL)
+		return;
 
 	config = json_object_object_get(in, "config");
 	if (config != NULL) {
-- 
2.51.0
